<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica's Kagiso buys stake in Reed's Butterworths.</title>
<headline>SAfrica's Kagiso buys stake in Reed's Butterworths.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Kagiso Investment Trust Ltd said on Thursday that it had agreed to buy a 50 percent shareholding in Butterworths from Reed Elsevier for 68.3 million rand.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition places KTI and its publishing interests in an ideal position to benefit from the worldwide expertise available within the Reed group of companies,&quot; Kagiso said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
